  "data": {
    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Event Companion",
    "summary": "This companion helps organisers and players run Singles events, from a local league to a world championship, using the current Chapter Approved Mission Deck. Games Workshop follows it at most of its events, and organisers may adapt it locally. It covers:\n\n- changes to mission and battlefield setup\n- errata and FAQs for mission cards\n- pairings and rankings\n- terrain layouts\n- current base sizes for eligible models\n\nDeployment and Twist cards aren't used in this format. Doubles, Teams and Dominatus events have their own guides.",
